{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27630","headline":"高闲上人 · 张祜","name":"高闲上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"座上辞安国，禅房恋沃州。\n道心黄叶老，诗思碧云秋。\n卷轴朝廷饯，书函内库收。\n陶欣入社叟，生怯论经俦。\n日色屏初揭，风声笔未休。\n长波溢海岸，大点出嵩丘。\n不绝羲之法，难穷智永流。\n殷勤一牋在，留着看银钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}